"┌session-20┌ Help ──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐──────────┐"
"│          │  Key          Action                                   │          │"
"│          │                                                        │          │"
"│          │  Enter        submit prompt / execute command          │          │"
"│          │  Shift+Enter  insert newline (Ctrl+J)                  │          │"
"│          │  Esc          cancel stream / close overlay            │          │"
"│          │  Ctrl+T       toggle running input target              │          │"
"│          │  Ctrl+P       open file picker                         │          │"
"│          │  Up/Down      recall prompt history                    │          │"
"│          │  ← →          move cursor (Ctrl+B/F)                   │          │"
"│          │  Home/End     line start/end (Ctrl+A/E)                │          │"
"│          │  Alt+← →      move by word (Ctrl+← →, Alt+B/F)         │          │"
"│          │  Backspace    delete char before cursor                │          │"
"│          │  Delete       delete char after cursor                 │          │"
"│          │  PgUp/PgDn    jump 10; Ctrl+Alt+U/D                    │          │"
"│          │  Ctrl+Alt+Y/E scroll by 1 line                         │          │"
"│          │  Mouse        select text; --mouse enables wheel       │          │"
"│          │  Ctrl+C       quit immediately                         │          │"
"│          │  Ctrl+D x2    quit (double-press within 3s)            │          │"
"└──────────│  Command      Description                              │──────────┘"
"───────────│                                                        │───────────"
"  ›  ▏     │  :            enter command mode                       │           "
"           │  ?            toggle this help overlay                 │           "
" · idle   m└  /clear       clear the transcript─────────────────────┘           "
